    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1868">

                <pb facs="1378" n="1262" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1262"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 419.11H23/49.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Price to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 18, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>After continued insistence I have just procured from the Panama Government
                    payment of $5,000 in settlement of William T. Harrington claim. San Francisco, I
                    believe, is the home of his widow. I will send a draft to the Department by next
                    pouch.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
